"Catatan ProductAttributeAssignment yang mendefinisikan atribut dan nilai\n"
"yang tersedia untuk variasi produk.\n"
"\n"
"Contoh permintaan:\n"
"```json\n"
"{\n"
"\"assignments\": [\n"
"            {\"attribute_id\": 1, \"value_ids\": [1, 2, 3], \"sort_order\": 0},\n"
"            {\"attribute_id\": 2, \"value_ids\": [5, 6], \"sort_order\": 1}\n"
"        ]\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"**Batasi Tingkat:** 30 permintaan per menit (operasi sensitif)\n"
"    "

