msgid "Verification failed. Please try again."
msgstr "Verifikasi gagal. Silakan coba lagi."

#: views/auth.py:131
msgid "Staff login"
msgstr "Login staf"

#: views/auth.py:132
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Authenticate a staff member and return access/refresh token pair.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 5 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **Request:**\n"
"    - email: Staff user email address\n"
"    - password: Account password\n"
"    - device_id: Unique device identifier\n"
"    - device_name: Optional human-readable device name\n"
"\n"
"    **Response (no 2FA):**\n"
"    - access_token: Short-lived token for API calls (30 min)\n"
"    - refresh_token: Long-lived token for refreshing access (14 days)\n"
"    - expires_in: Access token expiry in seconds\n"
"\n"
"    **Response (2FA required):**\n"
"    - requires_2fa: true\n"
"    - pending_token: Token to use for 2FA verification\n"
"    - expires_in: Seconds until pending token expires (5 min)\n"
"\n"
"    If the user has 2FA enabled, the response will include `requires_2fa: true`\n"
"    and a `pending_token`. Use the pending_token with POST /auth/verify-2fa/\n"
"    to complete authentication.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Autentikasi anggota staf dan kembalikan pasangan token akses/refresh.\n"
"\n"
"**Batasi Permintaan:** 5 permintaan per menit\n"
"\n"
"**Permintaan:**\n"
"- email: Alamat email pengguna staf\n"
"- password: Kata sandi akun\n"
"- device_id: Identifier perangkat unik\n"
"- device_name: Nama perangkat yang dapat dibaca oleh manusia (opsional)\n"
"\n"
"**Respons (tanpa 2FA):**\n"
"- access_token: Token yang berlaku singkat untuk panggilan API (30 menit)\n"
"- refresh_token: Token yang berlaku lama untuk memperbarui akses (14 hari)\n"
"- expires_in: Masa berlaku token akses dalam detik\n"
"\n"
"**Respons (2FA diperlukan):**\n"
"- requires_2fa: true\n"
"- pending_token: Token yang digunakan untuk verifikasi 2FA\n"
"- expires_in: Detik hingga token yang menunggu kedaluwarsa (5 menit)\n"
"\n"
"Jika pengguna memiliki 2FA yang diaktifkan, respons akan mencakup `requires_2fa: true`\n"
"dan `pending_token`. Gunakan pending_token dengan POST /auth/verify-2fa/\n"
"untuk menyelesaikan autentikasi.\n"
"    "

