#: views/inventory.py:45
msgid "Get inventory intelligence dashboard"
msgstr "Dapatkan dashboard intelijen inventaris"

#: views/inventory.py:46
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get comprehensive inventory dashboard data including stock status breakdown,\n"
"    top velocity products, and recent stockout information.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    Returns:\n"
"    - Total products and variants being tracked\n"
"    - Total stock value (on_hand * price)\n"
"    - Stock status counts (in_stock, low_stock, out_of_stock, overstock)\n"
"    - Stockouts in last 30 days\n"
"    - Top 5 fastest-selling products by velocity\n"
"    - 5 most recent products to reach zero stock\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Dapatkan data dashboard inventaris yang komprehensif termasuk analisis status stok,\n"
"produk dengan kecepatan penjualan teratas, dan informasi stok habis terbaru.\n"
"\n"
"**Batasan Tingkat:** 300 permintaan per menit\n"
"\n"
"Mengembalikan:\n"
"- Total produk dan variasi yang dilacak\n"
"- Nilai stok total (on_hand * harga)\n"
"- Jumlah status stok (in_stock, low_stock, out_of_stock, overstock)\n"
"- Stok habis dalam 30 hari terakhir\n"
"- 5 produk tercepat terjual berdasarkan kecepatan\n"
"- 5 produk terbaru yang mencapai stok nol\n"
"    "

