#| msgid "Get order details"
msgid "Get reorder suggestions"
msgstr "Dapatkan saran pembelian ulang"

#: views/inventory.py:583
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get products that need reordering based on sales velocity, lead time,\n"
"    and safety stock calculations.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **Urgency Levels:**\n"
"    - `immediate`: Less than 7 days of supply remaining\n"
"    - `soon`: 7-14 days of supply remaining\n"
"    - `upcoming`: 14-30 days of supply remaining\n"
"\n"
"    **Reorder Formula:**\n"
"    `suggested_qty = velocity * (lead_days + safety_multiplier * lead_days) - current_stock`\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Dapatkan produk yang memerlukan pemesanan ulang berdasarkan kecepatan penjualan, waktu pengiriman,\n"
"dan perhitungan stok aman.\n"
"\n"
"**Batas Permintaan:** 300 permintaan per menit\n"
"\n"
"**Tingkat Kepentingan:**\n"
"- `segera`: Stok tersisa kurang dari 7 hari\n"
"- `segera`: Stok tersisa 7-14 hari\n"
"- `mendatang`: Stok tersisa 14-30 hari\n"
"\n"
"**Rumus Pemesanan Ulang:**\n"
"`jumlah_disarankan = kecepatan * (hari_pengiriman + pengali_keamanan * hari_pengiriman) - stok_aktif`\n"
"    "

