msgstr "Daftar pesan pelanggan"

#: views/messages.py:273
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "    Get a paginated list of customer messages from all sources.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Sources:**\n"
#| "    - `contact_form`: Messages from contact form submissions\n"
#| "    - `order_note`: Customer notes attached to orders\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    Messages are sorted by newest first by default.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Deep Linking:**\n"
#| "    - For `source='contact_form'`: Use `message_id` to navigate to message detail\n"
#| "    - For `source='order_note'`: Use `order_number` to navigate to order detail\n"
#| "    "
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get a paginated list of customer messages from all sources.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **Sources:**\n"
"    - `contact_form`: Messages from contact form submissions\n"
"    - `order_note`: Customer notes attached to orders\n"
"\n"
"    Messages are sorted by latest activity by default (most recent reply or creation time).\n"
"\n"
"    **Deep Linking:**\n"
"    - For `source='contact_form'`: Use `message_id` to navigate to message detail\n"
"    - For `source='order_note'`: Use `order_number` to navigate to order detail\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Dapatkan daftar paginated dari pesan pelanggan dari semua sumber.\n"
"\n"
"**Batas Penggunaan:** 300 permintaan per menit\n"
"\n"
"**Sumber:**\n"
"- `contact_form`: Pesan dari pengiriman formulir kontak\n"
"- `order_note`: Catatan pelanggan yang terlampir ke pesanan\n"
"\n"
"Pesan diurutkan berdasarkan aktivitas terbaru secara default (waktu balasan terbaru atau waktu pembuatan).\n"
"\n"
"**Deep Linking:**\n"
"- Untuk `source='contact_form'`: Gunakan `message_id` untuk navigasi ke detail pesan\n"
"- Untuk `source='order_note'`: Gunakan `order_number` untuk navigasi ke detail pesanan\n"
"    "

#: views/messages.py:293
msgid "Filter by source: 'all', 'contact_form', 'order_note'"
msgstr "Saring berdasarkan sumber: 'all', 'contact_form', 'order_note'"

#: views/messages.py:301
