msgstr "Catatan pesanan hanya mendukung status \"read\"."

#: views/messages.py:741
msgid "Message status updated successfully."
msgstr "Status pesan telah diperbarui dengan sukses."

#: views/messages.py:750
msgid "Get unread message count"
msgstr "Dapatkan jumlah pesan belum dibaca"

#: views/messages.py:751
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "    Get the count of unread customer messages from all sources.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    Useful for badge display in the app.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    Returns breakdown by source:\n"
#| "    - `contact_form`: Unread contact form submissions\n"
#| "    - `order_note`: Unread customer notes on orders\n"
#| "    - `total`: Combined total\n"
#| "    "
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get the count of unread customer messages for the current user.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    Useful for badge display in the app. Counts are per-user — a message\n"
"    is \"unread\" if the current staff member has not read it yet, regardless\n"
"    of whether other staff members have.\n"
"\n"
"    Returns breakdown by source:\n"
"    - `contact_form`: Unread contact form submissions for this user\n"
"    - `order_note`: Unread customer notes on orders for this user\n"
"    - `total`: Combined total\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Dapatkan jumlah pesan pelanggan yang belum dibaca untuk pengguna saat ini.\n"
"\n"
"**Batas Tingkat:** 300 permintaan per menit\n"
"\n"
"Berguna untuk tampilan badge di aplikasi. Jumlah pesan berdasarkan pengguna — pesan dianggap \"belum dibaca\" jika staf saat ini belum membacanya, terlepas dari apakah staf lain sudah membacanya atau tidak.\n"
"\n"
"Mengembalikan pemecahan berdasarkan sumber:\n"
"- `contact_form`: Jumlah pengiriman formulir kontak yang belum dibaca untuk pengguna ini\n"
"- `order_note`: Catatan pelanggan pada pesanan yang belum dibaca untuk pengguna ini\n"
"- `total`: Total gabungan\n"
"    "

#: views/messages.py:819
msgid "Get message counts by status"
msgstr "Dapatkan jumlah pesan berdasarkan status"

#: views/messages.py:820
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "    Get count of messages by status and source for badge display.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    Returns counts for both sources:\n"
#| "    - `contact_form`: Full status breakdown (unread, read, replied, archived)\n"
#| "    - `order_note`: Simple status (unread, read)\n"
#| "    "
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get count of messages by status and source for badge display.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    The `unread_by_me` field shows messages the current user has not read,\n"
"    regardless of the message's global status.\n"
"\n"
"    Returns counts for both sources:\n"
"    - `contact_form`: Full status breakdown (unread, read, replied, archived)\n"
"    - `order_note`: Simple status (unread, read)\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Dapatkan jumlah pesan berdasarkan status dan sumber untuk tampilan badge.\n"
"\n"
"**Batas Tingkat:** 300 permintaan per menit\n"
"\n"
"Field `unread_by_me` menampilkan pesan yang belum dibaca oleh pengguna saat ini,\n"
"terlepas dari status global pesan tersebut.\n"
"\n"
"Mengembalikan jumlah untuk kedua sumber:\n"
"- `contact_form`: Pemecahan status lengkap (belum dibaca, sudah dibaca, dibalas, diarsipkan)\n"
"- `order_note`: Status sederhana (belum dibaca, sudah dibaca)\n"
"    "

#: views/messages.py:908
msgid "Reply to customer message"
msgstr "Balas pesan pelanggan"

#: views/messages.py:909
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Reply to a customer message from the contact form.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **URL Format:** `/messages/contact_form/{id}/reply/`\n"
"\n"
"    This endpoint:\n"
"    1. Stores the reply text against the message\n"
"    2. Updates message status to 'replied'\n"
"    3. Optionally sends an email to the customer\n"
"\n"
"    Note: This endpoint only works for `contact_form` messages.\n"
"    For order notes, use the order notes reply endpoint instead.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Balas pesan dari formulir kontak pelanggan.\n"
"\n"
"**Batas Permintaan:** 300 permintaan per menit\n"
"\n"
"**Format URL:** `/messages/contact_form/{id}/reply/`\n"
"\n"
"Endpoint ini:\n"
"1. Menyimpan teks balasan terhadap pesan\n"
"2. Memperbarui status pesan menjadi 'dibalas'\n"
"3. Secara opsional mengirimkan email ke pelanggan\n"
"\n"
"Catatan: Endpoint ini hanya berfungsi untuk pesan `contact_form`.\n"
"Untuk catatan pesanan, gunakan endpoint balasan catatan pesanan.\n"
"    "

#: views/messages.py:952
msgid "Invalid reply data."
msgstr "Data balasan tidak valid."

#: views/orders.py:47
msgid "List orders"
msgstr "Daftar pesanan"

#: views/orders.py:48
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "    Get a paginated list of orders with filtering and sorting.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Filtering:**\n"
#| "    Use either `status` for a specific status or `filter_type` for status groups.\n"
#| "    If `status` is provided (not 'all'), `filter_type` is ignored.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Filter Types (groups):**\n"
#| "    - all: All orders (default)\n"
#| "    - open: Orders with status pending or processing\n"
#| "    - completed: Orders with status shipped or delivered\n"
#| "    - refunded: Orders with status refunded or cancelled\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Sort Options:**\n"
#| "    - -created_at: Newest first (default)\n"
#| "    - created_at: Oldest first\n"
#| "    - -total_amount: Highest value first\n"
#| "    - total_amount: Lowest value first\n"
#| "    "
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get a paginated list of orders with filtering and sorting.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **Filtering:**\n"
"    Use either `status` for a specific status or `filter_type` for status groups.\n"
"    If `status` is provided (not 'all'), `filter_type` is ignored.\n"
"\n"
"    **Filter Types (groups):**\n"
"    - all: All orders (default)\n"
"    - open: Orders with status pending or processing\n"
"    - completed: Orders with status shipped or delivered\n"
"    - refunded: Orders with status refunded or cancelled\n"
"\n"
"    **Sort Options:**\n"
"    - -created_at: Newest first (default)\n"
"    - created_at: Oldest first\n"
"    - -total_amount: Highest value first\n"
"    - total_amount: Lowest value first\n"
"    - -updated_at: Recently updated first\n"
"    - updated_at: Least recently updated first\n"
"    - customer_name: Customer name A-Z\n"
"    - -customer_name: Customer name Z-A\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Dapatkan daftar terbatas dari pesanan dengan penyaringan dan pengurutan.\n"
"\n"
"**Batasi Permintaan:** 300 permintaan per menit\n"
"\n"
"**Penyaringan:**\n"
"Gunakan `status` untuk status tertentu atau `filter_type` untuk kelompok status.\n"
"Jika `status` disediakan (bukan 'all'), `filter_type` diabaikan.\n"
"\n"
"**Jenis Penyaringan (kelompok):**\n"
"- all: Semua pesanan (default)\n"
"- open: Pesanan dengan status pending atau processing\n"
"- completed: Pesanan dengan status shipped atau delivered\n"
"- refunded: Pesanan dengan status refunded atau cancelled\n"
"\n"
"**Opsi Pengurutan:**\n"
"- -created_at: Terbaru dahulu (default)\n"
"- created_at: Terlama dahulu\n"
"- -total_amount: Nilai tertinggi dahulu\n"
"- total_amount: Nilai terendah dahulu\n"
"- -updated_at: Terbaru dahulu\n"
"- updated_at: Terlama terakhir diperbarui\n"
"- customer_name: Nama pelanggan A-Z\n"
"- -customer_name: Nama pelanggan Z-A\n"
"    "

#: views/orders.py:79
