msgstr "Pesanan telah dibatalkan dengan sukses."

#: views/orders.py:770
msgid "Initiate refund"
msgstr "Mulai pengembalian dana"

#: views/orders.py:771
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Initiate a refund for an order.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 30 requests per minute (sensitive operation)\n"
"\n"
"    This endpoint initiates the refund process. Actual payment refund\n"
"    handling may depend on the payment provider configuration.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Mulai pengembalian dana untuk pesanan.\n"
"\n"
"**Batasi Tingkat:** 30 permintaan per menit (operasi sensitif)\n"
"\n"
"Endpoint ini memulai proses pengembalian dana. Penanganan pengembalian dana aktual\n"
