#: views/products.py:731
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get count of products by stock status for dashboard display.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    Returns counts for:\n"
"    - total: All published products that track inventory\n"
"    - in_stock: Products with available stock > low_stock_threshold\n"
"    - low_stock: Products with 0 < available stock <= low_stock_threshold\n"
"    - out_of_stock: Products with no available stock\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Dapatkan jumlah produk berdasarkan status stok untuk tampilan dashboard.\n"
"\n"
"**Batas Permintaan:** 300 permintaan per menit\n"
"\n"
"Mengembalikan jumlah untuk:\n"
"- total: Semua produk yang diterbitkan yang melacak inventaris\n"
"- in_stock: Produk dengan stok yang tersedia > low_stock_threshold\n"
"- low_stock: Produk dengan 0 < stok yang tersedia <= low_stock_threshold\n"
"- out_of_stock: Produk dengan tidak ada stok yang tersedia\n"
"    "

#: views/products.py:799
msgid "Upload product image"
msgstr "Unggah gambar produk"

#: views/products.py:800
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Upload a new image for a product.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    The uploaded image will be:\n"
"    - Converted to WebP format for optimal delivery\n"
"    - Thumbnails generated (small: 150x150, medium: 300x300, large: 600x600)\n"
"    - Linked to the product\n"
"\n"
"    **Supported formats:** JPEG, PNG, GIF, WebP\n"
"    **Max file size:** 10MB (configurable)\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Upload ulang gambar untuk produk.\n"
"\n"
"**Batas Permintaan:** 300 permintaan per menit\n"
"\n"
"Gambar yang diunggah akan:\n"
"- Diubah menjadi format WebP untuk pengiriman optimal\n"
"- Dibuatkan thumbnail (kecil: 150x150, sedang: 300x300, besar: 600x600)\n"
"- Dikaitkan dengan produk\n"
"\n"
"**Format yang Didukung:** JPEG, PNG, GIF, WebP\n"
"**Ukuran maksimal file:** 10MB (dapat dikonfigurasi)\n"
"    "

#: views/products.py:985
