#: views/settings.py:38
msgid "Get app settings"
msgstr "Dapatkan pengaturan aplikasi"

#: views/settings.py:39
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get current app settings including user info, store info, and notification preferences.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Dapatkan pengaturan aplikasi saat ini termasuk informasi pengguna, informasi toko, dan preferensi pemberitahuan.\n"
"\n"
"**Batasi Tingkat:** 300 permintaan per menit\n"
"    "

#: views/settings.py:112
msgid "Register device for push notifications"
msgstr "Daftarkan perangkat untuk notifikasi push"

#: views/settings.py:113
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Register a device to receive push notifications.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    If the device is already registered, updates the push token and preferences.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Daftarkan perangkat untuk menerima notifikasi push.\n"
"\n"
"**Batas Pengiriman:** 300 permintaan per menit\n"
"\n"
"Jika perangkat sudah terdaftar, perbarui token push dan preferensi.\n"
"    "

#: views/settings.py:141
