"**Batas Permintaan:** 300 permintaan per menit\n"
"    "

#: views/sso.py:66
msgid "Get SSO configuration"
msgstr "Dapatkan konfigurasi SSO"

#: views/sso.py:67
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Check if SSO is enabled and get provider details.\n"
"\n"
"    **Public** — no authentication required.\n"
"    Called by the iOS app on login screen load to decide whether to show the SSO button.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Periksa apakah SSO aktif dan dapatkan detail penyedia.\n"
"\n"
"**Umum** — tidak memerlukan autentikasi.\n"
"Dipanggil oleh aplikasi iOS saat halaman login dimuat untuk menentukan apakah tombol SSO harus ditampilkan.\n"
"    "

#: views/sso.py:97
msgid "Initiate SSO login"
msgstr "Mulai login SSO"

#: views/sso.py:98
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Start the OIDC authorization flow for mobile SSO.\n"
"\n"
"    **Public** — no authentication required.\n"
"    The iOS app opens this URL in ASWebAuthenticationSession. Returns a 302 redirect\n"
"    to the identity provider's authorization endpoint.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Mulai alur otorisasi OIDC untuk SSO mobile.\n"
"\n"
"**Umum** — tidak memerlukan autentikasi.\n"
"Aplikasi iOS membuka URL ini dalam ASWebAuthenticationSession. Mengembalikan redirect 302 ke akhir titik otorisasi penyedia identitas.\n"
"    "

#: views/sso.py:131
msgid "device_id parameter is required and must be a valid identifier."
msgstr ""
"Parameter device_id diperlukan dan harus merupakan identifikasi yang valid."

#: views/sso.py:145
msgid "SSO is not enabled or not configured."
msgstr "SSO tidak diaktifkan atau tidak dikonfigurasi."

#: views/sso.py:352
msgid "Exchange SSO code for tokens"
msgstr "Tukar kode SSO dengan token"

#: views/sso.py:353
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Exchange a one-time SSO code for access/refresh tokens.\n"
"\n"
"    **Public** — no authentication required.\n"
"    Called by the iOS app after receiving the one-time code from the SSO callback redirect.\n"
"    Returns the same response shape as the password login endpoint.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Tukar kode SSO sekali pakai untuk token akses/refresh.\n"
"\n"
"**Publik** — tidak memerlukan otentikasi.\n"
"Dipanggil oleh aplikasi iOS setelah menerima kode sekali pakai dari redirect callback SSO.\n"
"Mengembalikan bentuk respons yang sama dengan endpoint login kata sandi.\n"
"    "

#: views/sso.py:397
msgid "code and a valid device_id are required."
msgstr "code dan device_id yang valid diperlukan."

#: views/sso.py:413 views/sso.py:427 views/sso.py:465
msgid "Invalid or expired SSO code."
msgstr "Kode SSO tidak valid atau telah kedaluwarsa."

#: views/sso.py:446
msgid "Device mismatch."
msgstr "Tidak cocok dengan perangkat."

#: views/sso.py:491
msgid "User is not authorized."
msgstr "Pengguna tidak memiliki otorisasi."

#: views/sso.py:526
msgid "Maximum device limit reached. Please logout from another device."
msgstr "Batas perangkat telah tercapai. Silakan keluar dari perangkat lain."

